doctype html
html(lang='en')
  include common_head.pug
  body
    // Navigation Bar
    include menu.pug
    section.py-5
      .container
        h2.text-center.mb-5 About Nexlify Software
        .row.mb-5
          .col-md-8
            h3 Our Story
            p
              | Founded in 2015, Nexlify Software began with a vision to revolutionize the tech industry by delivering innovative and reliable software solutions. Our team of passionate developers, designers, and strategists work collaboratively to create products that empower businesses worldwide.
            p
              | Over the years, we&rsquo;ve grown into a trusted partner for companies seeking custom software, cloud solutions, and mobile applications, all while maintaining our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction.
          .col-md-4
            img.img-fluid.rounded(src='images/aboutus.png', alt='Our team')
        .row.mb-5
          .col-md-8.order-md-2
            h3 Our Mission
            p
              | At Nexlify Software, our mission is to harness the power of technology to transform businesses. We strive to deliver solutions that are not only functional but also intuitive, scalable, and future-proof, ensuring our clients stay ahead in a competitive landscape.
          .col-md-4.order-md-1
            img.img-fluid.rounded(src='images/mission.jpg', alt='Our mission')
        .row
          .col-md-12.text-center
            h3 Our Values
            .row.text-center.mt-4
              .col-md-4.mb-4
                i.bi.bi-lightbulb.feature-icon
                h5.mt-3 Innovation
                p
                  | We embrace creativity and push the boundaries of technology to deliver groundbreaking solutions.
              .col-md-4.mb-4
                i.bi.bi-shield-check.feature-icon
                h5.mt-3 Integrity
                p
                  | We build trust through transparency, honesty, and ethical practices in all our endeavors.
              .col-md-4.mb-4
                i.bi.bi-people.feature-icon
                h5.mt-3 Collaboration
                p
                  | We believe in the power of teamwork, working closely with clients to achieve shared goals.
    // Footer
    include footer.pug